# The Fourth State, step 1 (docs/net/STORY.md)
POST LETTERS 1985-10-07 20:30 IRINA
SUBJECT A DIGIT THAT IS NOT THERE
MY TERNCLOCK SOMETIMES SHOWS A FOURTH SIGN AMONG THE -, 0 AND +. IT LOOKS LIKE A SMALL RING. IT IS GONE BEFORE I CAN PEEK AT IT. IS MY COPY OF THE LISTING WRONG?
.

POST LETTERS 1985-10-10 09:40 EDITORS
SUBJECT RE: A DIGIT NOT THERE
A TYPING ERROR, SURELY. THE FONT OF THE TRIADA-85 HAS NO SUCH SIGN. CHECK LINE 40 OF YOUR LISTING.
.

POST LETTERS 1985-10-14 23:55 MATVEI
SUBJECT RE: A DIGIT NOT THERE
I TYPED THE LISTING AGAIN, LETTER BY LETTER. I SAW THE RING TOO. ONCE. AT 23:13.
.
